                  "content": "fill glass-tint (site: sand-0 42% light, #1C1918 40% dark) + background_blur radius glass-blur = 28 in Pencil, which exports as CSS blur(14px) and equals PRD 02's blur(14px). glass-tint-strong (80%) is the site's denser variant for unpredictable backdrops. Flutter: BackdropFilter sigma to match.",
                  "lineHeight": "$type-body-sm-lh",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-family",
