          "height": 0,
          "content": "Semantics labels (Flutter, Bahasa Indonesia) for icon-only controls:\narrow_back = Kembali · close = Tutup · notifications = Notifikasi, {n} belum dibaca · more_vert = Menu lainnya · search = Cari · tune = Filter · add = Tambah motor · edit = Ubah · delete = Hapus · share = Bagikan · content_copy = Salin dari motor lain · open_in_new = Buka di Maps · refresh = Coba lagi.\nExcluded from semantics (decorative, the label text carries the meaning): badge status icons, chevron_right on list rows, nav icons that have a text label."
        }
      ]
