              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The brand's signature surface, used on exactly two components: the bottom NavBar and the StickyEstimateBar. Recipe: background blur + tint + 1px inner border + sheen (two inner shadows) + drop shadow. Budget: 1–2 glass surfaces per screen, never stacked; everything else is flat surface-card.",
