        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "l8y6P",
          "name": "Handoff Notes",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "JqxtU",
              "name": "Note Pattern",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "NAV PATTERN PER WINDOW CLASS (PRD 06)\nCompact < 600: glass NavBar (4 items, 16 dp side inset, 12 dp above the gesture bar). Medium 600-839: NavRail 80 dp. Expanded 840-1199: NavRail 80 dp. Large >= 1200: extended NavRail 240 dp with TsLogo. Rail height = fill_container (masters are 400 dp specimens). Selected item = accent-soft pill + weight 700 icon + heading label; unselected = weight 400 + body label.\nGlass budget: NavBar is 1 of the max 2 BackdropFilter widgets per screen; StickyEstimateBar (glass) never shows together with NavBar on the same screen (booking flow hides the bar)."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "n28aK",
              "name": "Note Focus",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "FOCUS + KEYBOARD\nNav items: focus = 2 dp focus-ring on the pill (offset 0, the pill is the indicator); arrow keys move between destinations, Enter / Space selects, Tab leaves the nav. Each item's hit area is its whole quarter of the bar (>= 48 x 50) even though the pill is 72 wide.\nText scale 1.3: labels stay one line (Label Medium 12 -> 15.6), the bar grows to fit; the rail switches Medium -> Large before wrapping.\nTheme switch is instant."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "i90PxY",
              "name": "Note Semantics",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "SEMANTICS (Flutter)\nNavigationBar / NavigationRail destinations: label + icon, selected state announced ('Beranda, tab 1 dari 4, terpilih'). App bar back = 'Kembali', bell = 'Notifikasi, 3 belum dibaca', sheet close = 'Tutup'. Sheet drag handle: Semantics(label: 'Geser untuk menutup', excludeSemantics) with a visible close button as the non-gesture path. App bar title: maxLines 1, TextOverflow.ellipsis; the full text is reachable in the screen body."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
