              "name": "Note Motion",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "MOTION\nEmpty / error content enters with a 250 ms fade + 8 dp rise (route-level, not per element). Retry: press 150 ms, then the screen shows Skeleton (>= 300 ms) or the inline spinner.\nSkeleton shimmer: 1.4 s linear loop, one sweep of skeleton-highlight per cycle. Reduce motion (MediaQuery.disableAnimations): static skeleton-base, no loop."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "F8eXfp",
              "name": "Note Semantics",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "SEMANTICS\nEmptyState: announce title + body as one group; the CTA is a normal button. ErrorState: liveRegion on the message so screen readers announce the failure; retry = 'Coba lagi'. Illustrations are decorative: ExcludeSemantics. Skeleton: Semantics(label: 'Memuat...', liveRegion) on the first placeholder only; the rest are excluded."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "msHYM",
              "name": "Note Usage",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "USAGE\nEmpty garage S07 / S10, riwayat S19, notifikasi S06, filter kosong S12 / S13. Full-page ErrorState replaces a screen body (mock network failure, Mode Demo toggle); Inline ErrorState replaces one card or list (catalog fetch inside S11). Tablet: content centered, max-width 560; illustration size unchanged."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
