          "children": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "xVRz4",
              "name": "Note Workshop Card",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 384,
              "content": "WORKSHOP CARD\nWhole card taps to S14 (phone) or selects into the detail pane (expanded / large list-detail, selected state). Name: maxLines 2 + ellipsis; rating and distance use id_ID decimals (4,8 · 1,2 km). Buka / Tutup is a text badge with an icon. Photo slot keeps its 80 x 80 aspect box while loading or when absent (placeholder art only, never a real business photo).\nSemantics: 'Bengkel Jaya Motor, bintang 4,8, 1,2 kilometer, buka sampai 17.00, 2 bay'."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "MAlTa",
              "name": "Note Slot Chips",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 468,
              "content": "SLOT CHIPS: RULES\nSlots run 08.00-16.00 hourly, D+0 only if 2+ hours ahead. Limited = remaining <= 2 (Sisa n). In shared-slot mode a slot with fewer seats than selected units is Short (disabled, 'Sisa n', the S15 capacity banner explains 'Kapasitas tidak cukup untuk N motor'); in split mode only remaining >= 1 matters. Full = Penuh, disabled.\nSemantics: '09.00, tersisa 2, dipilih' / '12.00, kapasitas tidak cukup untuk 2 motor, tidak tersedia' / '13.00, penuh, tidak tersedia'. Disabled chips stay focusable for screen readers but do not select. Motion: select 150 ms ease-out, reduce motion instant."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "hPafT",
              "name": "Note Date Strip",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 384,
              "content": "DATE STRIP: SCROLL + SNAP\nHorizontal list D+0 to D+14 that snaps to item starts; the selected date scrolls into view; a 24 dp bg-page fade marks the cut edge and the next item peeks. Month caption shows on every item so a month change reads without extra chrome. Today carries the words 'Hari ini' (not a color alone). At medium+ widths S15 switches to the side-by-side layout in step 09 (date grid).\nSemantics: 'Selasa 29 September, dipilih' / 'Kamis 24 September, hari ini'."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
