              "content": "PRICE BREAKDOWN\nUnit rows are ExpansionTile-style: the whole 48 dp row toggles, chevron is decoration. Collapsed by default on S16 so the fleet subtotal and total stay in view; invoice (S23) shows every unit. Voucher line = sell icon + label + minus sign in success-text on success-soft. Totals come from the domain layer (makespan on the workshop's bays), never computed in the widget.\nSemantics: 'Beat 110, subtotal Rp143.000, ditutup' / 'dibuka'. Pane variant is sticky at expanded / large; the CTA is Konfirmasi booking (disabled while recomputing)."
