    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "Lu2KB",
      "x": 2640,
      "y": 25176,
      "name": "S05 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "nab4h",
          "name": "Note Entry Points",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 300,
          "content": "S05 ENTRY POINTS\nBooking CTA -> S10 (nothing pre-selected). ActiveBookingCard -> S20 (whole card). Draft card and 'Lanjutkan' resume at the last step; 'Hapus draft' -> confirm dialog -> draft removed and the card disappears. Garage card -> S09, 'Tambah motor' -> S08, 'Lihat semua' -> S07. Quick links: Riwayat -> S19, Katalog suku cadang -> S12. Bell -> S06. Nav: Beranda (here), Riwayat S19, Garasi S07, Profil S25."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "xJe8l",
          "name": "Note States Motion",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 468,
          "content": "STATES + MOTION\nLoading: real app bar (bell without badge), greeting, CTA and quick links; skeleton for the booking / draft slot, promo and garage cards. Shimmer loop 1.2 s, static under MediaQuery.disableAnimations. Skeleton -> content: 250 ms fade (instant with reduce-motion).\nEmpty: no booking, no draft -> hero CTA with the matic silhouette. Populated: compact CTA, booking, draft, promo, garage, quick links.\nPromo: auto-advance 5 s, pauses on touch / focus / hover, off with reduce-motion; announced 'Promo 1 dari 3'; the dots are a non-interactive cue.\n1-motor frame: the only motor is in service, so no draft can exist (PRD 03)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "e5pHN",
          "name": "Note Semantics Focus",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 384,
          "content": "SEMANTICS + FOCUS ORDER\nBell: 'Notifikasi, 2 belum dibaca' (no badge: 'Notifikasi'). Greeting = heading. Headings: greeting and 'Garasi saya'. Links: 'Lihat semua motor' and 'Lihat semua booking aktif' (never a bare 'Lihat semua'). Focus order: bell, CTA, active booking, draft (card, Hapus draft, Lanjutkan), promo, Lihat semua motor, garage cards, Tambah motor, Riwayat, Katalog, then the nav (tablet: rail first). Cards expose one label for their content; status is text + badge, and the segments are excluded from semantics because the label already names each unit."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "whCSt",
          "name": "Note Layout Stress",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 342,
          "content": "LAYOUT + STRESS\nFrames are full-scroll captures (height = content); the fold sits at 800 dp (marker left of the first frame). 16 dp sides, 16 dp gap, bottom padding 92 dp above the gesture bar so the last row clears the glass NavBar. Stress 360x640: a viewport, clipped at the bottom on purpose (scrolls). Stress x1.3: every text node x1.3, rows and cards grow, nothing clips. Emoji: Pencil draws the greeting emoji as a monochrome glyph (fill applies); Flutter shows the color emoji."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "jbbHk",
      "x": 9712,
      "y": 25176,
      "name": "S05 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Portrait",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "FrSPm",
          "name": "Note Tablet Portrait",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 258,
          "content": "TABLET-PORTRAIT 800 x 1280\nNavRail 80 + content 720 (24 dp sides). Bar: greeting title + bell (the rail carries the logo). Grid: CTA spans; ActiveBookingCard | DraftResumeCard 328 each; promo spans (one wide slide); garage 5 cards fill the row; two quick links. With no draft, the quick links take the second cell of the status row."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "i2ctxX",
      "x": 16012,
      "y": 25176,
      "name": "S05 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Landscape",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "RUhpN",
          "name": "Note Tablet Landscape",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "TABLET-LANDSCAPE 1280 x 800\nExtended NavRail 240 + content 1040. Same grid at 488 per column; promo two-up (voucher + multi-motor); garage 5 cards ~188 wide. Populated is a full-scroll capture (981 high, fold at 800)."
        }
      ]
    },
