              "content": "S10 Pilih motor parts: close-leading app bar, flat SelectionFooter (counter + reason line + Lanjut), full-width AddMotorCard, card skeleton, and the non-destructive booking-exit dialog reused by every booking step. The booking flow has no NavBar / NavRail (decided at the step 06 kickoff).",
