    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "lJODO",
      "x": 3520,
      "y": 36640,
      "name": "S10 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "l8ntnZ",
          "name": "Note Entry Points",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 363,
          "content": "S10 ENTRY POINTS\nHome CTA -> S10 empty (nothing pre-selected). Garasi 'Booking motor ini' -> S10 with that motor pre-checked. Detail Bengkel (S14) 'Booking di sini' -> S10 empty, workshop carried forward, S13 skipped. Riwayat 'Booking lagi' -> the same motors pre-checked; a motor that is now in service (or deleted) comes back unchecked and disabled. Pre-checked cards look identical to user-selected cards (no hint). Resuming a draft skips S10 and opens at the last step. No NavBar in the booking flow."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "qWzOX",
          "name": "Note Exit Add Motor",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 321,
          "content": "EXIT + ADD MOTOR\nClose (X) and system back: 0 motors selected -> leave at once, nothing to save. 1+ selected -> 'Keluar dari booking?' (Simpan & keluar / Lanjutkan booking). Confirm -> draft saved for 24 h -> Home shows 'Lanjutkan booking'. 'Tambah motor lain' and the empty-state CTA -> S08 -> back here: the new motor is available but NOT auto-selected, snackbar 'Motor ditambahkan'. The add card stays enabled at max-reached."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "QVCC4",
          "name": "Note States Motion",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 405,
          "content": "STATES + MOTION\nLoading: real app bar, stepper and helper; 3 skeleton cards; Lanjut disabled, no counter. Empty: garage illustration + 'Tambah motor pertamamu', no footer. None selected: Lanjut disabled + 'Pilih minimal 1 motor'. Selected: 3 dari 5; Ninja 250 'Sedang dalam servis' (icon + text, not opacity only). Max-reached (Demo: garage 6 motor): 5 selected, the 6th 'Maks. 5 motor', footer 'Lepas satu untuk memilih motor lain'; selected cards stay tappable to deselect. Select toggle 150 ms; shimmer loop 1.2 s, static with MediaQuery.disableAnimations; skeleton -> content 250 ms fade."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "QWcfc",
          "name": "Note Semantics Layout",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 426,
          "content": "SEMANTICS + FOCUS + LAYOUT\nCard label: 'Vario 125, AB 1234 XY, dipilih' / '..., belum dipilih' / '..., tidak bisa dipilih: sedang dalam servis' / '..., tidak bisa dipilih: batas 5 motor tercapai'. Disabled cards stay focusable so the reason is read out. Counter = polite live region. Close = 'Tutup booking'. Focus order: close, cards in list order, Tambah motor lain, Lanjut. Frames are full-scroll captures (fold at 800 dp, marker left of the first frame); the footer is sticky above the gesture inset. Nickname: 2 lines then ellipsis, full value in the label and S09. Stress 360x640 is a clipped viewport; x1.3 grows every row, nothing clips."
        }
      ]
    },
