        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "g17RGx",
          "name": "Handoff Notes",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "h6baTf",
              "name": "Notes Row 1",
              "gap": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "eFLty",
                  "name": "Note Footer AppBar",
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 405,
                  "content": "SELECTIONFOOTER + APP BAR\nFlat sticky footer (surface-card + 1 px top border), above the gesture inset, no glass. Counter 'N dari 5 motor dipilih' is a polite live region and uses tabular figures (FontFeature.tabularFigures) so it does not shift as digits change. Lanjut disabled at 0: the reason line 'Pilih minimal 1 motor' is its programmatic hint. At 5: 'Lepas satu untuk memilih motor lain'. Close icon: Semantics 'Tutup booking'; system back does the same. Both follow the exit rule (dialog only with 1+ motor selected). Tablet: the footer spans the frame, its row is padded to the content max-width (720 / 1040)."
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "PJULl",
                  "name": "Note Exit Dialog",
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 468,
                  "content": "EXIT DIALOG (booking-flow pattern)\nConfirm-save variant, reused by S11-S16. Shown only when the draft holds 1+ selection; with 0 selected back / close exit at once. Non-destructive: primary 'Simpan & keluar' (draft saved 24 h, Home shows 'Lanjutkan booking'), secondary 'Lanjutkan booking' (Outline). No danger hue. Actions stack: both labels are too wide side by side on 312 dp. Discard stays on Home ('Hapus draft'). Scrim = new token 'scrim'.\nModal: focus moves to the title on open (announced), Tab cycles Simpan & keluar -> Lanjutkan booking, system back and scrim tap = 'Lanjutkan booking' (the safe default), focus returns to the close icon. Motion: 250 ms fade + 8 dp rise; fade only with reduce-motion."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "MAQ7l",
              "name": "Notes Row 2",
              "gap": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "DjnRs",
                  "name": "Note Add Card Loading",
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 384,
                  "content": "ADD CARD + LOADING\n'Tambah motor lain' opens S08; it stays enabled at max-reached (garage size is not selection size). Back from S08: the new motor is available and NOT auto-selected; snackbar 'Motor ditambahkan'. Loading card = skeleton rows, static shimmer specimen; shimmer loop 1.2 s, off with MediaQuery.disableAnimations; skeleton -> content 250 ms fade (instant with reduce-motion). Loading announces 'Memuat daftar motor' once (polite live region). Disabled cards (in service / max) stay focusable (aria-disabled) so their reason is read out."
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "JvaUU",
                  "name": "Note Sample Motors",
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 279,
                  "content": "DEMO GARAGE\nS10 garage: Vario 125, Beat 110, PCX 160 (selected, become S11 units A / B / C), Supra X 125 (free), Ninja 250 (Sedang dalam servis). Max-reached specimen ('Demo: garage 6 motor') adds Scoopy 110 (AB 2468 TP, matic, sheet-only). Cards keep garage order; nickname 2 lines then ellipsis, full value in the semantics label."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
