    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "oJ2W5",
      "x": 5280,
      "y": 38790,
      "name": "S11 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "u6o20",
          "name": "Note Frames Overlays",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 363,
          "content": "S11 FRAMES\nFull-scroll captures (fold marker at 800 dp on the left); the estimate bar is sticky above the gesture inset, so in a capture it sits at the end of the page. Overlays (source sheet, remove dialog) are placed in the top 800 dp viewport. Single unit: no chip row and no stepper badge. Multi unit: the chip row scrolls with a 24 dp edge fade; the active chip keeps its status glyph. Keyboard is a fixed 800 dp viewport: content scrolls so the field stays visible, the bar sits above the keyboard."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "Y5mYVe",
          "name": "Note Estimate Prices",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 384,
          "content": "ESTIMATE + PRICES\nThe bar sums every ticked service and part on all units; a unit with nothing adds 0; duration = makespan on 2 bays. Canonical run: 1 unit Rp85.000 / 1 jam, 2 units Rp228.000 / 1 jam, 3 units Rp428.000 / 2 jam. Beat = Servis Berkala + AHM Oil MPX1 (Rp143.000); PCX = Servis Berkala + AHM Oil MPX2 + Kampas Rem (Rp200.000). Complaint Required is a specimen (Perbaikan/Keluhan from Rp50.000 makes it Rp363.000). Prices for Ganti Oli, Perbaikan and the spark plugs are mock proposals for services.json / parts.json in step 19."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "yZ6rO",
          "name": "Note Flow Navigation",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 342,
          "content": "FLOW + NAVIGATION\nBack goes to S10 (draft kept); close asks 'Keluar dari booking?' only with 1+ selection. Lanjut is enabled when every chip shows the check; the disabled bar names what is missing ('Tulis keluhan untuk PCX 160'). Chip switching keeps each unit's in-progress state. Parts are filtered by the unit's model: an incompatible part is hidden here (S12 shows the badge). 'Lihat semua' opens the S12 sheet (step 15); its selections sync back to the active unit."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "yc40e",
          "name": "Note Loading Error Semantics",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 342,
          "content": "LOADING, ERROR, SEMANTICS\nLoading: real app bar, stepper, chips and header; skeleton tiles; bar 'Menghitung estimasi…' with the Lanjut spinner (disabled); shimmer is static with MediaQuery.disableAnimations. Error: inline ErrorState + bar error variant, both 'Coba lagi' retry the catalog. Semantics: tab 'Beat 110, lengkap, dipilih'; tile 'Servis Berkala, Rp85.000, 60 menit, dipilih'; the estimate bar is a polite live region; Lihat semua 'Lihat semua suku cadang'."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ZDhFY",
