              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "S11 Detail servis tablet parts (step 07b): the live EstimatePane of the large layout (static per-unit lines, no voucher; the S16 PriceBreakdown pane stays S16's), the centered modal form of the Salin dari source sheet, and the wide stepper carrying the completion badge. The booking flow has no NavBar / NavRail.",
