    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "xQw1b",
      "x": 4840,
      "y": 48676,
      "name": "S15 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "cCOGq",
          "name": "S15 Note · Slot States",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 384,
          "content": "SLOT STATES\nState per slot: short (remaining < units, shared mode) > limited (remaining ≤ 2) > available; full when booked ≥ capacity. Capacity counts motors per hour, so captions read \"Sisa 2 motor\". For 3 motors limited cannot show in shared mode (≤ 2 is already short); it shows in split mode (each unit needs 1 seat) and for 1–2-unit bookings. Never color alone: icon + caption + border recipe. Semantics: \"09.00, tersedia\" · \"10.00, sisa 2 motor, terbatas\" · \"10.00, hanya muat 2 motor, tidak bisa untuk 3 motor\" · \"12.00, penuh\" · \"08.00, lewat\"."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "ycPi9",
          "name": "S15 Note · Capacity Banner",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 342,
          "content": "CAPACITY BANNER\nDerived from the selected day's chips, not from a tap on a disabled chip (Flutter disabled controls take no taps and screen readers skip them). At least one short chip and some slot still fits → Info tone. No slot fits all 3 motors → Warning tone + body. The action (\"Pisah jadwal\" / \"Pisah jadwal per motor\") turns split mode on, same as the toggle. Focus order: workshop row → toggle → strip → banner action → chips → footer. The banner sits above the grid so it is read before the chips."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "B4K9Lv",
          "name": "S15 Note · Split Mode",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 384,
          "content": "SPLIT MODE\nThe toggle keeps both drafts: the shared slot and the per-unit slots are stored separately, only the active mode counts; no dialog, nothing is cleared. Accordion: one unit open at a time; collapsed row = motor + plate + chosen slot or \"Pilih jam\". Capacity counts siblings: remaining = slot remaining − units already placed there (Vario on 11.00 → Beat sees 11.00 \"Penuh\" + row \"11.00 sudah dipakai Vario 125\"). Footer \"n dari 3 motor terjadwal\"; Lanjut only when every unit has a slot. Race case: re-validated on S16 (step 10, same CapacityBanner)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "K6HhGP",
          "name": "S15 Note · Date And Motion",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 426,
          "content": "DATE, D+0, MOTION\nStrip = D+0…D+14 (Sen 28 Sep … Sen 12 Okt), snap to items, 24 dp fade + a half-visible item as the scroll cue; the month is in each item caption. Changing the date clears the shared slot (Lanjut disabled: \"Pilih jam kedatangan\"). D+0: slots earlier than now + 2 h are disabled \"Lewat\" with a helper (demo now = 10.20). All-full day: \"Semua slot penuh\" + action to the next day that fits all motors. Motion: chip select 150 ms ease-out, accordion 250 ms; MediaQuery.disableAnimations → instant; no state by motion alone. Network error via Mode Demo = \"Coba lagi\" banner (annotation only)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "AlAfU",
          "name": "S15 Note · Semantics",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 489,
          "content": "SEMANTICS (FLUTTER)\nDate strip item and calendar cell: \"Sel, 29 September 2026, dipilih\" · \"Sen, 28 September 2026, hari ini\" via Semantics(selected). The calendar grid is one focus group: arrow keys move by day and week, Enter selects, Tab leaves the grid. \"Pisah jadwal per motor\" = Switch named by its label, value \"aktif\" / \"nonaktif\"; toggling announces the new mode. UnitSlotSection header = button: \"Beat 110, AB 5678 ZZ, belum ada jam, terbuka\" (expanded state announced); the check / circle glyph and the chevron are decorative. CapacityBanner = polite live region announced when the day changes; its action is a normal button after it. A disabled Lanjut keeps the footer reason line as its hint. Back = \"Kembali\", close = \"Tutup\"."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "CYu2r",
      "x": 14176,
      "y": 48676,
      "name": "S15 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Portrait",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "lD5tI",
          "name": "S15 Note · Tablet-Portrait",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 279,
          "content": "TABLET-PORTRAIT (800)\nNo NavRail in the booking flow. App bar full width; wide BookingStepper and content column centered at 720. The date strip is 720 wide (about 9 items + fade); the slot grid stays 3 × 3 with wider chips. Footer spans the frame, its row padded to 40 dp so the recap and Lanjut align with the content edge. Split mode = the same accordion at 720."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "OswHO",
      "x": 16140,
      "y": 48676,
      "name": "S15 Handoff Notes · Expanded",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "RZZue",
          "name": "S15 Note · Expanded",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 237,
          "content": "EXPANDED (1024×768)\n24 margins · left column 400 (workshop row, toggle, 2-week calendar; 7 cells × 48 dp + gaps inside a 368 dp panel) · slot pane 552 with the footer pinned at its bottom (row padded to 24). Calendar cells are 48 × 56 dp; the grid replaces the strip from 840 dp up."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "muC2a",
      "x": 23900,
      "y": 48676,
      "name": "S15 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Landscape",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "I91Gll",
          "name": "S15 Note · Tablet-Landscape",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 300,
          "content": "TABLET-LANDSCAPE (1280)\nShared: 24 margins · left column 480 (workshop row, toggle, 2-week calendar grid) · slot pane 728 (heading, banner, 3 × 3 grid, footer pinned at the pane bottom). Calendar = 7 × 3, Sen–Min header, D+0 in its weekday column, cells 48 × 56 dp, reading order row by row. Split: unit rail 252 (S11 rail-row, second line = chosen slot or \"Pilih jam\") · calendar 420 · slot pane. Dark: shared populated only."
        }
      ]
    },
