    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "O6b86",
      "x": 4400,
      "y": 50826,
      "name": "S16 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "Nh3aL",
          "name": "S16 Note · Edit Links",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 321,
          "content": "EDIT LINKS AND RETURN\nUbah bengkel → S13 (the schedule must be redone, so S15 follows). Ubah jadwal → S15. Ubah <motor> → S11 for that unit. Each returns to S16, which shows the Loading state while it recomputes. Links carry unit-specific semantics: \"Ubah bengkel\", \"Ubah jadwal\", \"Ubah Vario 125\" (never a bare \"Ubah\"). Back → S15 (draft kept). Close → the exit dialog (always: S16 has selections): \"Simpan & keluar\" / \"Lanjutkan booking\"."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "f7TqSr",
          "name": "S16 Note · Estimate",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 468,
          "content": "ESTIMATE AND DURATION\nEvery price is an estimate: the block is titled \"Estimasi biaya\", the total reads \"Total estimasi\" (instance text overrides; the S23 invoice keeps \"Total\"). One static line per unit → Subtotal → Diskon → Total. With no voucher the Subtotal and Diskon rows are omitted. Shared arrival: duration = makespan over the workshop's bays (2 bays, 3 × 60 min → 2 jam, caption \"dikerjakan bergantian di 2 bay\"). Split: arrivals differ, so the caption is per unit (\"Estimasi 1 jam per motor · datang di jam berbeda\"). Amounts change when a voucher is applied or removed: use tabular figures (FontFeature.tabularFigures) so the total does not jump. The sticky bar repeats the total on phone; one merged announcement: \"Total estimasi Rp385.200\"."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "eXknK",
          "name": "S16 Note · Voucher",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 321,
          "content": "VOUCHER ROW\nEmpty: \"Pilih voucher\" + count of usable vouchers → S17 (single motor: \"Belum ada yang berlaku — lihat syaratnya\", still opens S17 to show why). Applied: name + \"Hemat Rp42.800\"; the row body opens S17 to change; \"Hapus\" (semantics \"Hapus voucher\") removes it in one tap → snackbar \"Voucher dilepas · Urungkan\" (S11 undo pattern). The discount line is its own row with icon + minus sign + text, never color alone."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "q5Mqx",
          "name": "S16 Note · Slot Invalid",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 342,
          "content": "RE-VALIDATION AND SLOT INVALID\nThe slot is re-validated on entering S16 and after every edit. If it no longer fits (mock race: Sel 29 Sep 09.00 now holds 2 seats for 3 motors): CapacityBanner Warning as a polite live region with \"Pisah jadwal\" (→ S15, split on) and \"Pilih jam lain\" (→ S15). The Jadwal row shows warning icon + \"Jam tidak tersedia\" + border, \"Ubah jadwal\" is the way out, the CTA is disabled with the reason \"Pilih jadwal baru untuk lanjut\". Totals stay visible."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "p0KyvG",
          "name": "S16 Note · Confirm",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 321,
          "content": "CONFIRM\n\"Konfirmasi booking\" → CTA loading \"Mengonfirmasi…\" (mock ≈ 1.2 s); back, close, Ubah and Hapus are disabled while it runs → S18. Error (Mode Demo, forced): inline banner pinned above the bar, icon + \"Booking belum terkirim\" + \"Coba lagi\", polite live region; the CTA returns to normal and the page stays scrollable. No snackbar (it would auto-dismiss over the CTA). Flat bar, no glass on S16 (budget 0 of 2)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "z88cE2",
          "name": "S16 Note · Semantics",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 510,
          "content": "SEMANTICS AND MOTION\nAccordion header = one target: \"Vario 125, Servis Berkala + 1 suku cadang, ditutup\" / \"dibuka\" (button role, expanded state). The chevron is part of that target: decorative, excluded from semantics, never a second focus stop. \"Ubah Vario 125\" is a separate 48 dp target. The estimate block reads as one group in order. Loading / recomputing: the estimate block and voucher row are hidden from semantics and a polite live region says \"Menghitung ulang estimasi\", then \"Total estimasi Rp385.200\". Focus order: back → close → Ubah bengkel → Ubah jadwal → accordions (header, Ubah) → voucher row (Hapus) → confirm bar. Reduce motion (MediaQuery.disableAnimations): accordion 150 ms expand → instant, skeleton shimmer static. Text scale 1.3: rows wrap, nothing clips."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "pJc3f",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 53470,
      "name": "S17 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "Mpd6M",
          "name": "S17 Note · Apply Model",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 363,
          "content": "APPLY MODEL\nFull page /booking/summary/voucher, opened only from S16 (it needs a draft). Radio list: eligible cards are selectable, ineligible cards are disabled with the reason; \"Tidak pakai voucher\" is the last option. The footer previews the result (\"Total estimasi Rp385.200 · Hemat Rp42.800\"); \"Terapkan\" applies and pops to S16 and is disabled while the choice equals the applied voucher. Back discards an unsaved choice, no dialog. Promo / notification voucher CTAs start a booking (S10) and carry the voucher id."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "lDVR7",
          "name": "S17 Note · Eligibility",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 405,
          "content": "ELIGIBILITY\nRules: minUnits, minSubtotal (vouchers.json). Sorted: eligible by saving, then ineligible. Reason names the fix: \"Butuh min. 4 motor\", \"Min. belanja Rp500.000 — kurang Rp72.000\" (computed, not stored). Single motor (Rp85.000): all four are ineligible, including \"Butuh min. 2 motor\"; \"Tidak pakai voucher\" is selected and the CTA is disabled with \"Belum ada voucher yang berlaku\". Flutter skips disabled controls, so an ineligible card is a focusable read-only node (Semantics label with the reason, no radio action), and its reason is icon + text on screen."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "YqICX",
          "name": "S17 Note · States",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 363,
          "content": "STATES AND SEMANTICS\nLoading: four card skeletons, static shimmer with reduce motion; a polite live region says \"Memuat voucher\" and the list is hidden from semantics until it arrives. Empty (no vouchers at all): icon + \"Belum ada voucher\" + \"Voucher dari promo akan muncul di sini.\" (no illustration). Semantics: \"Diskon 10% servis ≥2 motor, hemat Rp42.800, terpilih\" · \"Diskon 15% servis ≥4 motor, tidak bisa dipakai, butuh min. 4 motor\" · \"Tidak pakai voucher\"; the radio group is announced as \"Pilih voucher\"; the footer preview is one group."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "m8sZeE",
      "x": 16240,
      "y": 50826,
      "name": "S16 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Portrait",
