          "name": "S16 Note · Tablet-Portrait",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 321,
          "content": "TABLET-PORTRAIT\nFixed viewport 800×1280, no status bar, no NavBar (booking chrome). App bar full width, wide stepper 720 centered, content column 720 (PRD 06 stacked, max 720). The flat bar spans the width with its content aligned to the 720 column: total left, CTA right (240 / 280 wide); in the Disabled state the reason sits between them. Accordions default collapsed here so the column fits above the bar; a tapped accordion scrolls the column."
        }
      ]
    },
