          "name": "S16 Note · Tablet-Landscape",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 279,
          "content": "TABLET-LANDSCAPE 1280×800\nCentered group: recap 720 · gap 24 · pane 360 = 1104 (88 dp side margins, as S11 with one unit). The pane is sticky: VoucherRow, Estimasi biaya, PaymentNote, CTA (disabled with a reason line on invalid slot; loading shows skeletons and \"Menghitung ulang…\"). Left column scrolls; PCX 160 is expanded on the ready frame only."
        }
