    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "r882gh",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 16708,
      "name": "S01 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "oWA1R",
          "name": "S01 Note · Splash and session",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 363,
          "content": "SPLASH AND SESSION CHECK\nAuto-advances after at least 800 ms and the persisted-session check: first launch → S02, valid session → S05 (no onboarding). No spinner, no progress bar. The mark is the TsLogo tile (never below 24 dp). Wordmark: the 'Wordmark' frame shows the end state; it fades in below the mark after about 400 ms (opacity 0 → 1, 250 ms, Curves.easeOut). With MediaQuery.disableAnimations the wordmark is shown at once, no fade. Android 12+: use the mark on bg-page as the system splash icon so the handoff has no flash."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "jBjsP",
          "name": "S01 Note · Semantics",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 237,
          "content": "SEMANTICS AND LAYOUT\nThe splash is one live region \"TumbasServis\", announced once; nothing is focusable. Tablets (both orientations) keep the same centered mark, no reflow. Dark: the mark tile switches to orange-400 with the near-black monogram (TsLogo token), background bg-page dark."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "jVmxo",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 18814,
      "name": "S02 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "k6FV7",
          "name": "S02 Note · Slides and controls",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 489,
          "content": "SLIDES AND CONTROLS\nSwipe (PageView) or the CTA advances: 'Lanjut' on slides 1–2, 'Mulai' on slide 3 (→ S03). 'Lewati' (top-right, 48 dp target, semantics \"Lewati onboarding\") jumps to S03 and is hidden on slide 3. The PageIndicator is a position cue, not a control; it announces \"Slide 1 dari 3\". On swipe the art moves with the page (parallax at most 24 dp, 250 ms); with MediaQuery.disableAnimations the page just snaps. Titles are the PRD copy; bodies are 1–2 lines.\n\nFOCUS ORDER: Lewati → Lanjut / Mulai. On the accent-soft band the focus ring uses text-on-accent-soft: the shared focus-ring (orange-500) measures 2.92 : 1 on accent-soft (light), under 3 : 1; token-level decision goes to step 19."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "QrT01",
          "name": "S02 Note · Art and tablets",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 321,
          "content": "ART, THEME AND TABLETS\nThe three illustrations are generated once and snapped to tokens (text-body, accent, surface-card, surface-inset) on an accent-soft panel, so they flip with the theme. Tablet-Portrait: card 560 with a 400 dp art band, titles Headline Large. Tablet-Landscape: content column 480 on the left, 640 art panel on the right, titles Display Small. Only slide 1 is drawn on tablets; slides 2–3 reuse the same layout with their art swapped in."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "Dfuw0",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 20920,
      "name": "S03 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "YFaZu",
          "name": "S03 Note · Validation",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 363,
          "content": "VALIDATION AND STATES\nThe field groups digits as typed (812-3456-7890); +62 is a fixed prefix; valid = 9–12 digits after +62, a leading 0 is dropped. The error shows on submit or on blur: danger border + icon + \"Nomor tidak valid. Contoh: 812-3456-7890\" (never colour alone), the typed digits stay. 'Kirim kode OTP' is never disabled. Loading: the button shows the spinner (TsButton loading) and the field is read-only. Network error (mock): TsSnackbar Error \"Gagal mengirim kode. Cek koneksi, lalu coba lagi.\" with action 'Coba lagi'."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "d2KXqb",
          "name": "S03 Note · Keyboard and terms",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 468,
          "content": "KEYBOARD AND TERMS\nKeyboardType.phone (the numeric pad shown is design-only, System / Keyboard Numeric). Content scrolls above the keyboard and the CTA stays reachable (PRD global pattern). 'Syarat & Ketentuan' and 'Kebijakan Privasi.' are underlined text-accent links; tap → snackbar \"Segera hadir\" (demo). Submit → S04. The logo lockup is TsLogo Mark+Wordmark Compact (mark 32 dp).\n\nFOCUS AND SEMANTICS: focus order = phone field → clear button (×, semantics \"Hapus nomor\", shown only while there is text) → Kirim kode OTP → Syarat & Ketentuan → Kebijakan Privasi. Links and buttons show the 2 dp focus-ring (specimens on the Auth blocks sheet)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "XUTEw",
          "name": "Note Motion",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 230,
          "content": "MOTION — the field error and the CTA spinner change state in 150 ms ease-out; the OTP route push uses the 250 ms page transition. Under MediaQuery.disableAnimations every change is instant. State never rides on motion alone: the error keeps its danger border + icon + text and loading keeps the spinner label."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "I7hdF",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 23048,
      "name": "S04 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "o4r4uZ",
          "name": "S04 Note · OTP behaviour",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 470,
          "content": "OTP BEHAVIOUR\nSix cells (48 × 56 dp on phone) auto-advance on every digit; backspace goes back; pasting 6 digits fills all cells. 'Verifikasi' stays disabled until all six are filled, with the reason line \"Masukkan 6 digit kode\" under it (info icon + text, the SelectionFooter reason recipe, removed once the sixth digit is in); there is no auto-submit. The demo code 123456 always succeeds → S05 (session persisted). Any other code → error: cells clear, focus returns to cell 1, danger border + icon + \"Kode salah. Cek lagi 6 digitnya atau kirim ulang kode.\". The shake (±6 dp, 3 cycles, 250 ms) is a hint only and is skipped under MediaQuery.disableAnimations. SMS auto-fill is out of scope."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "JwQQg",
          "name": "S04 Note · Resend and demo hint",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 468,
          "content": "RESEND AND DEMO HINT\nResend is disabled behind a 30 s countdown (\"Kirim ulang kode dalam 0:30\", one live-region announcement every 10 s), then becomes the accent link 'Kirim ulang kode' and restarts the countdown. 'Ganti nomor' returns to S03. The blue 'Kode demo: 123456' line exists only in demo mode (build flag) and is icon + text. Semantics: cells announce \"Digit 1 dari 6\", back button \"Kembali\". The keyboard frame shows the filled state: CTA enabled, above the numeric pad.\n\nFOCUS ORDER: back → Ganti nomor → cells 1–6 → Kirim ulang kode → Verifikasi. Ganti nomor and Kirim ulang kode are 48 dp text links with a 2 dp focus-ring (Auth blocks sheet)."
        }
      ]
    },
