    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "mKbc9",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 30106,
      "name": "S07 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "G7myqr",
          "name": "S07 Note · Navigation and entry points",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 447,
          "content": "NAVIGATION\nGarasi is a tab of AppShell (bottom NavBar on phone, NavRail on tablets). Tap a card → S09 with that motor. Header '+' (semantics 'Tambah motor') → S08 (add); it is the only add action while the garage has motors (no add card in the list). With an empty garage the '+' is hidden (title-only bar) and the empty-state CTA 'Tambah motor' is the only add action → S08. From S05 the garage strip tile → S09, its '+' tile → S08.\n\nOUTCOMES\nSave in S08 returns to S07 with the snackbar 'Motor ditambahkan' (edit: 'Perubahan disimpan'). Delete in S09 returns to S07 with 'Motor dihapus'."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "x7Moly",
          "name": "S07 Note · Cards, states and semantics",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 573,
          "content": "CARDS\nVehicleSelectCard Mode=Display. A motor in service adds a UnitStatusBadge (icon + text, never colour only); tapping still opens S09. Garage order is kept, no re-sorting. Plate and model stay on one line with ellipsis; the nickname is capped at 20 characters in S08 so a card never truncates.\n\nSTATES\nLoading = 3 skeleton cards (shimmer 1.2 s loop, static under MediaQuery.disableAnimations). Empty = title-only app bar (no '+') + EmptyState (Garage) with its CTA. Tablets: 2 columns (Tab-P, content 720) and 3 columns (Tab-L).\n\nSEMANTICS\nCard: 'Beat 110, AB 5678 ZZ, Honda Beat 110, Dikerjakan'. Header '+': 'Tambah motor'. Focus order: header '+' → cards in order."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "XLcGW",
      "x": 3520,
      "y": 32234,
      "name": "S08 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "wtn97",
          "name": "S08 Note · Fields and validation",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 636,
          "content": "FIELDS\nNickname (max 20, counter '9/20', prefilled from the model name once one is picked), Model (read-only field, opens the picker), Plate, Year (optional, numeric keypad), Photo (optional).\n\nPLATE\nAuto-uppercase and spacing as typed (1–2 letters, 1–4 digits, 0–3 letters: AB 1234 XY). Error on blur or submit, typed value kept: 'Format plat tidak valid. Contoh: AB 1234 XY'; duplicate: 'Plat ini sudah ada di garasimu'. Model empty: 'Pilih model motor.'. Year: 'Tahun 1990–2026'. Errors are icon + text + danger border, never colour only. Silhouette in the photo tile follows the chosen model category (matic until a model is picked).\n\nSUBMIT\nWith errors, focus moves to the first invalid field (order: nickname, model, plate, year) and its error text is announced with the label. The save-error banner is a polite live region and stays until dismissed or the next attempt."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "vTLy2",
          "name": "S08 Note · Save, cancel and errors",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 447,
          "content": "SAVE\nFlat sticky footer, 'Simpan' ('Simpan perubahan' when editing), always enabled; validation runs on submit. Saving = spinner button + fields disabled (state also visible through the disabled field style). Save error = inline banner 'Gagal menyimpan. Cek koneksi, lalu coba lagi.' + 'Coba lagi'; the form stays editable.\n\nCANCEL\nBack on a dirty form (at least one field changed) → dialog 'Buang perubahan?' with 'Lanjut mengisi' (primary) and 'Buang'. A clean form leaves at once. Entry from S10 inline: after save go back to S10, snackbar 'Motor ditambahkan', the new motor is NOT auto-selected."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "hgetc",
          "name": "S08 Note · Picker, photo, keyboard",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 783,
          "content": "MODEL PICKER\nPhone = bottom sheet (open 250 ms; under MediaQuery.disableAnimations fade only). Tablet = centered modal 560. Search filters brand and model; brand headers stay sticky; tap a row = select + close, the current model shows a check. No result: 'Model tidak ditemukan' (Empty Search specimen on the Garage blocks sheet).\n\nPHOTO\n'Tambah foto (opsional)' opens a Kamera / Galeri / Hapus foto sheet; permission denied → snackbar with a settings action. No photo = silhouette by category. Photo slot keeps a fixed 96 dp box.\n\nKEYBOARD\nContent scrolls above the keyboard, the footer sits on top of it. Semantics: back 'Kembali'; model field 'Model motor, pilih model'; focus order: nickname → model → plate → year → Simpan.\n\nFOCUS\nOpening the picker moves focus to the search field ('Cari merek atau model') and keeps it inside (background inert). Escape or the close button (semantics 'Tutup') closes it and returns focus to the Model field. Rows announce 'Beat 110, Honda, Matic, 110 cc' and 'terpilih' on the current model."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "hJcRT",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 34362,
      "name": "S09 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "dxjF2",
          "name": "S09 Note · Actions and entry points",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 804,
          "content": "ENTRY\nFrom S07 card, S05 garage strip tile. 'Booking motor ini' → S10 with this motor pre-checked (F2 entry). Edit (app bar, semantics 'Ubah motor') → S08 in edit mode.\n\nIN SERVICE\nThe CTA is disabled with the reason 'Sedang dalam servis. Kamu bisa booking lagi setelah servis selesai.' and a 'Lacak servis' link → S20 (the active booking). The status badge repeats the state (icon + text). A free motor shows the enabled CTA and no reason row.\n\nDELETE\n'Hapus motor' is the last item on the page, danger text, always enabled. Free motor → confirm dialog (danger 'Hapus', ghost 'Batal') → S07 + snackbar 'Motor dihapus'. Motor in a booking → informational dialog, no danger action: 'Motor ini punya booking aktif' with 'Lihat booking' (→ S20) / 'Tutup'.\n\nDISABLED CTA\nThe disabled 'Booking motor ini' stays one semantics node: 'Booking motor ini, tidak tersedia. Sedang dalam servis' (enabled: false + hint = the reason), so the reason is announced with the button. FOCUS ORDER: back → edit → Booking motor ini → Lacak servis → Lihat semua → history rows → Hapus motor."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "RLv3f",
          "name": "S09 Note · History",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 426,
          "content": "RIWAYAT SERVIS\nActive booking first (accent border, tap → S20), then the 3 latest past bookings (Selesai → S23 invoice path via S20, Dibatalkan → S20). 'Lihat semua' → S19 Riwayat pre-filtered to this motor (semantics 'Lihat semua riwayat Beat 110'). Empty: 'Belum ada riwayat servis. Booking pertama motor ini akan muncul di sini.' (no illustration, no link).\n\nROWS\nCode + date + services summary (2 lines max, ellipsis) + UnitStatusBadge; every row is one 48+ dp target. Row semantics: 'TS-260910-0091, Kamis 10 September 2026, Servis Berkala + Oli, Selesai'."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "f6dxl9",
          "name": "Note Motion",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "MOTION — the delete and blocked dialogs fade + scale in over 150 ms ease-out; the page follows the 250 ms route transition. Under MediaQuery.disableAnimations both dialogs appear instantly. The in-service state stays a text badge + the disabled CTA reason line, never motion-only."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "BRKOr",
      "x": 10504,
      "y": 30106,
      "name": "S07 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Landscape",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "U4urZY",
          "name": "S07 Note · Tablet layout",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Tab-P (800×1280): NavRail 80, content 720, 2-column grid. Tab-L (1280×800): NavRail, 3-column grid. Cards are fill_container, so phone and tablet cannot drift; equal-height rows (the free card stretches to its in-service neighbour)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "gomHv",
      "x": 11748,
      "y": 32234,
      "name": "S08 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Landscape",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "Gz6HH",
          "name": "S08 Note · Tablet layout",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 279,
          "content": "Tab-P: centered form 560, footer bar with the button aligned to the form; picker = centered modal 560 (Layout=Modal). Tab-L: form column 560 with the 'Simpan' button pinned at its foot + MotorPreviewPane 360 on the right (live preview of the Display card: silhouette by category, nickname, plate, model as they are typed; placeholders in muted text until then). Year sits beside the plate on tablets."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "hBgQk",
      "x": 8704,
      "y": 34362,
      "name": "S09 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Landscape",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "E6QRJ8",
          "name": "S09 Note · Tablet layout",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 279,
          "content": "Tab-P: stacked, content max 720; the frame is taller than 1280 because the page scrolls (full-scroll capture). Tab-L (1280×800): hero + booking CTA in the left column (400) with 'Hapus motor' pinned at its foot; details (MotorDetails Layout=Grid) + history in the right column (640), which scrolls independently. The delete link moved to the hero column so it stays visible in a fixed viewport."
        }
      ]
    },
