    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "i0dW3",
      "x": 4400,
      "y": 41474,
      "name": "S12 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "QZIEm",
          "name": "S12 Note · Entry and commit",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 594,
          "content": "ENTRY\nSelect mode: S11 'Lihat semua' (Suku cadang / Oli card) for the active unit. The page opens with that unit's ticks (Beat 110: AHM Oil MPX1). Browse mode: S05 quick link 'Katalog suku cadang'; no unit, no cart, back arrow instead of close.\n\nCOMMIT (STAGED)\nTicks stay local. 'Selesai' commits them to the active unit and returns to S11; a part outside the S11 shortlist is appended to the S11 list. Close (X) or system back with changes opens 'Buang perubahan?' ('Lanjut memilih' primary, 'Buang'); with no changes the page closes at once. 'Selesai' stays enabled with 0 ticked (it empties the unit's parts).\n\nBAR\nFlat sticky SelectedPartsBar: count + 'Suku cadang Rp…' + Selesai, above the keyboard and the gesture inset. S11's StickyEstimateBar remains the only glass bar."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "Jbixy",
          "name": "S12 Note · Compatibility and detail",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 552,
          "content": "RULE\nA part fits when the unit's MotorModel.category matches and its cc lies in the part's range (Beat 110 = matic 110 cc). 'Hanya yang cocok untuk Beat 110' (TsSwitch, default ON) hides the rest. OFF: the 7 incompatible tiles stay in category order with a disabled checkbox and the reason badge 'Tidak cocok · untuk matic 125–160 cc' (icon + text, never color alone).\n\nDETAIL\nBottom sheet on phone, centered modal 560 on tablet: 'Detail suku cadang', Spesifikasi, Kecocokan (rule line + garage rows; select mode shows the active unit, browse shows the four garage motors). CTA 'Tambah ke booking' / 'Hapus dari booking' toggles the same staged selection (not a second commit). An incompatible part keeps the CTA disabled with the reason above it. Browse has no CTA, only close."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "m38edl",
          "name": "S12 Note · Semantics, focus and states",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 909,
          "content": "SEMANTICS\nCheckbox: 'Pilih AHM Oil MPX1, Rp58.000' (state announced). Tile body: 'Lihat detail AHM Oil MPX1'; two targets per tile, each 48 dp or more. Toggle: 'Hanya yang cocok untuk Beat 110, aktif'. Chips: selectable group 'Kategori'; the scroll fade is decorative. Search: label 'Cari suku cadang', clear button 'Hapus pencarian'. App bar: close 'Tutup katalog' (select) / back 'Kembali' (browse). Bar: count + total + 'Selesai' read as one node. Compat row: 'Beat 110, AB 5678 ZZ, cocok'. Sheet / modal: focus moves in and stays inside, Escape closes, focus returns to the tile; close button 'Tutup'.\n\nANNOUNCEMENTS\nPolite live region: result count after a search, category or toggle change ('7 suku cadang'); selection count and total after a tick ('2 dipilih, Rp103.000'). Counter and total use tabular figures (FontFeature.tabularFigures).\n\nFOCUS ORDER\nClose, search, chips, toggle, then per tile checkbox and body, then 'Selesai'.\n\nSTATES\nLoading = real header + skeleton tiles, 'Selesai' disabled; reduce-motion = no shimmer; announce 'Memuat katalog'. Empty search = illustration + 'Hapus pencarian'. Error = the S11 inline ErrorState 'Katalog gagal dimuat' + 'Coba lagi' (not framed). Sheet 250 ms slide, reduce-motion = fade only. Keyboard: content scrolls above it and the bar stays above the keyboard. No cart, no quantity."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "I6iL3k",
      "x": 12868,
      "y": 41474,
      "name": "S12 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Landscape",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "CYOan",
          "name": "S12 Note · Tablet layout",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 447,
          "content": "TABLET\nFull-screen page, no rail (booking-flow chrome). Tab-P: content column 720, header row = unit + search, all 7 chips fit, 2-col grid (tiles 352). Tab-L: content 1232, header row = unit + search, tools row = chips + toggle, 4-col grid (tiles 296); the bar spans the frame with 24 dp content padding.\n\nGrid tile = PartOptionTile / Layout=Grid: the checkbox (top right) toggles, the body opens the detail modal (560, centered, scrim). The Tab-P frame shows the modal; Tab-L opens the same modal.\n\nTablet frames are fixed viewports; the grid scrolls under the pinned bar."
        }
      ]
    },
