    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "r5Ran",
      "x": 2640,
      "y": 60760,
      "name": "S20 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "width": 420,
      "fill": "$surface-inset",
      "cornerRadius": "$radius-lg",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 12,
      "padding": 16,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "whEnl",
          "name": "Note 1",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 321,
          "content": "STATUS MACHINE — unit: Terjadwal → Check-in/Antre → Diperiksa → Dikerjakan → QC → Selesai; Dibatalkan possible from any pre-Selesai state. Booking status DERIVED from units: any Dikerjakan/Diperiksa/QC/Antre → Berlangsung; all Selesai → Selesai; all cancelled → Dibatalkan; else Terjadwal."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "QIql0",
          "name": "Note 2",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 447,
          "content": "DISABLED ACTIONS — Ubah jadwal & Batalkan only while booking = Terjadwal (pre check-in). Reason line always visible under disabled CTA (matches S09/S11 pattern). Selesai: Lihat invoice → S23, Booking lagi → F2 with same units prefilled; Beri ulasan → S24 stays DISABLED with reason 'Tandai lunas di invoice dulu' until the invoice is Lunas (frames: Selesai Belum Lunas / Selesai Lunas); after a review it reads 'Lihat ulasan'."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "Y99Kum",
          "name": "Note 3",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 258,
          "content": "SYNC RULE — every unit status change updates: S05 active card + fleet progress, S20 unit rows, S21 timeline (if open), and pushes an in-app notification (S06). Auto-advance timer in Mode Demo only."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "A9hMW",
          "name": "Note 4",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "REBOOK — Dibatalkan & Selesai 'Booking lagi' opens F2 with workshop+units prefilled, schedule cleared."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "DwNWr",
          "name": "Note 4",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 237,
          "content": "WORKSHOP ROW — whole row is tappable (chevron) → S14 standalone (CTA 'Booking di sini', workshop carried). S20 never changes the workshop; there is no 'Ubah' link here."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "HiqYH",
          "name": "Semantics note",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 400,
          "content": "SEMANTICS — Back icon: 'Kembali'. Workshop row: 'Bengkel Jaya Motor, 2 bay servis, buka detail bengkel'. Unit row: 'Vario 125, Unit A, Terjadwal, buka lacak unit'. Disabled 'Ubah jadwal' / 'Batalkan' / 'Beri ulasan' stay focusable (Semantics enabled: false) and read their reason line as the hint. Fleet progress announces '3 motor: 2 dikerjakan, 1 diperiksa'."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "e8isll",
          "name": "Note Motion",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 370,
          "content": "MOTION — a unit status change swaps the badge and fills its FleetProgress segment in 150 ms ease-out; Ubah jadwal and Batalkan open with the 250 ms route transition. Under MediaQuery.disableAnimations the swap and the fill are instant. The status stays readable from the badge text and the meta line (never motion-only)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "onQBI",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 63544,
      "name": "S21 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "width": 420,
      "fill": "$surface-inset",
      "cornerRadius": "$radius-lg",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 12,
      "padding": 16,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "hrVQP",
          "name": "Note 1",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 279,
          "content": "MOTION — timeline reveal 300ms staggered per node on entry; current node pulse ring 1.2s loop. Non-motion cue: bold label + 'Sedang dikerjakan' caption (never motion-only). Reduce-motion: pulse + stagger off, state stays via weight/caption."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "vNpsr",
          "name": "Note 2",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "ETA — 'Estimasi selesai' card updates on each status change (mock +30min per remaining stage). Completed: exact time shown."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "lcdkq",
          "name": "Note 3",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "MECHANIC PER UNIT — this frame = unit -B (Mas Rudi ★4,8). Unit A = Mas Andi; unit C = not yet assigned (Not Assigned variant). Assignment shown after Check-in."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "E7V2b",
          "name": "Note 4",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "MODE DEMO — card is reviewer control only, visually separated (inset surface, MODE DEMO label). Majukan status = one stage; Reset = back to Terjadwal. Mirrors S26."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "CL5Yp",
          "name": "Note 5",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "TAP SOURCE — S20 unit row / S05 card unit chip → S21 for that unit; back returns to source."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "SmCn1",
          "name": "Semantics note",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 400,
          "content": "SEMANTICS — Back icon: 'Kembali'. Timeline = ordered list; nodes read 'Dikerjakan, sedang berlangsung, mulai 09.15' / 'Check-in, selesai 08.40' / 'QC, belum dimulai'. The ETA card is a polite live region ('Estimasi selesai sekitar 10.15'); each status change announces once. Mode Demo buttons: 'Majukan status', 'Reset'. Timestamps and ETA use tabular figures."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "EDpGd",
      "x": 2200,
      "y": 66022,
      "name": "S22 Handoff Notes · Phone",
      "width": 420,
      "fill": "$surface-inset",
      "cornerRadius": "$radius-lg",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 12,
      "padding": 16,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "ZUv55",
          "name": "Note 1",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 468,
          "content": "UBAH JADWAL — opens only while Terjadwal (same gate as S20 action). Bottom sheet, anchored to the bottom edge (24 dp gesture inset inside the sheet). Re-runs slot availability live (F2 rules): full slots disable as 'Penuh', D+0 slots before now+2h = 'Lewat'. Current slot marked 'Jadwal sekarang' (reselecting it = no-op save). Flat footer 'Simpan jadwal'; success snackbar 'Jadwal diperbarui' + S20 refresh. Split-mode reschedule = future work (annotation only)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "q4s37G",
          "name": "Note 2",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 279,
          "content": "BATALKAN — centered dialog, TsDialog styling (radius-xl, shadow): scope radio (Seluruh booking · 3 motor / Hanya <motor> · Unit -X), optional reason chips (wrap by width). Kembali = ghost first, Ya, batalkan = danger solid last."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "G0OiWE",
          "name": "Note 3",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 258,
          "content": "CANCEL RULES — cancelling ALL units cancels the booking; cancelling some units recomputes pricing for remaining units (voucher eligibility re-checked: DISKON10 needs ≥2 motor). Cancelled units release their slot seats."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "fXnUX",
          "name": "Note 4",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "ERROR/LOADING — save is optimistic-blocked: footer button → loading; on failure inline error above footer, sheet stays open, selection preserved."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "k5YCd9",
          "name": "Semantics note",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 483,
          "content": "SEMANTICS — Ubah jadwal sheet: modal route, focus moves to the title, close icon = 'Tutup', focus returns to 'Ubah jadwal' on dismiss; slot chips read 'Jam 09.00, sisa 2 motor' / 'Jam 09.00, penuh'. Batalkan dialog: modal route, focus lands on the title, scope group = radio group 'Cakupan pembatalan', reason chips = 'Alasan pembatalan (opsional)', 'Ya, batalkan' is the danger action, Escape / 'Kembali' dismiss without cancelling. Saving announces 'Menyimpan jadwal'."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "pebCU",
          "name": "Note Motion",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 344,
          "content": "MOTION — the Ubah jadwal sheet slides up in 250 ms ease-out; the Batalkan dialog fades + scales in over 150 ms. Under MediaQuery.disableAnimations both fade only. Saving keeps the button spinner + label and a failure keeps the inline error text, so no state is carried by motion alone."
        }
      ]
    },
