    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "MiFp5",
      "x": 2640,
      "y": 68662,
      "name": "Handoff Notes / S23 Invoice",
      "width": 560,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "bDX6N",
          "name": "Note · Generation",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "S23 — invoice is generated when the booking reaches Selesai (all units Selesai). Reached from S20 \"Lihat invoice\" or the notification deep link. Reference = booking code TS-260929-0417; issued Sel 29 Sep 2026 · 11.08."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "sEoRU",
          "name": "Note · Tandai Lunas",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Tandai Lunas is a mock action (no payment). Tap → confirm dialog (non-destructive: \"Ya, tandai lunas\" / \"Kembali\") → CTA loading → Lunas banner + tag, footer becomes \"Beri Ulasan\". Announce \"Invoice ditandai lunas\" (polite live region). Failure: FormErrorBanner + \"Coba lagi\"; S26 \"Simulasikan galat jaringan\" forces it."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "clBMr",
          "name": "Note · Paid state",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Paid = success-soft PaidBanner + PaymentStatusTag (icon + text, not color alone), \"Dibayar Sel, 29 Sep 2026 · 11.24\". Unlocks S24: S20 \"Beri ulasan\" becomes enabled (before: disabled with reason \"Tandai lunas di invoice dulu\"; step 16 / S20 handoff)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "NDzGq",
          "name": "Note · Layout",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 260,
          "content": "Phone: stacked + flat sticky ConfirmBar (total + CTA). Tablet-P: centered 640, bar = total left / CTA 280 right. Tablet-L: breakdown 720 left, InvoiceSummaryCard 360 right (pane holds total, voucher, workshop, CTA). No NavBar / NavRail. Loading: skeleton, announce \"Memuat invoice\" politely; the CTA stays disabled with the reason line."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "Ffzpk",
          "name": "Note · P2 share",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "P2 \"Bagikan\" (share invoice as text / image through the OS share sheet) = app-bar icon action, Paid state only; Semantics label \"Bagikan invoice\". Default frames stay without it."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "TI9gc",
          "name": "Note · Arithmetic",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 240,
          "content": "Rp85.000 + Rp143.000 + Rp200.000 = Rp428.000 · DISKON10 −Rp42.800 · Total Rp385.200 (same as S16 / S18). Every amount, the counter and every time use tabular figures (tabular-nums). CTA labels are sentence case (\"Tandai lunas\", \"Beri ulasan\") like S16 / S18."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "YPW51",
          "name": "Note Motion",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "MOTION — the Tandai lunas dialog fades + scales in over 150 ms ease-out; on confirm the PaidBanner fades in (150 ms) and the footer label swaps to Beri ulasan. Under MediaQuery.disableAnimations every switch is instant. Paid is carried by the banner text + PaymentStatusTag (icon + label), never by motion alone."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "IqkD2",
      "x": 2640,
      "y": 70904,
      "name": "Handoff Notes / S24 Beri Ulasan",
      "width": 560,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "q6iuR",
          "name": "Note · Star input",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Star input = one adjustable control per rating: 5 whole stars, 48 dp targets, no half taps. Semantics label \"Nilai bengkel\", value \"4 dari 5\"; arrow Left / Right ±1, Home / End = 1 / 5. Live word label (Buruk · Kurang · Cukup · Baik · Sangat baik) announced politely. Filled vs outline shape carries the state, not color alone. Selection feedback 150 ms (none with reduce-motion)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "fmb92",
          "name": "Note · Validation",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Submit is always enabled. Missing workshop rating → danger border + inline error \"Pilih bintang untuk bengkel\", scroll to the card, announce it. Comment and mechanic ratings are optional; unrated mechanics are omitted from Review.mechanicRatings."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "pWISV",
          "name": "Note · Mechanics",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "One row per distinct mechanic with the units they served. Shown only when 2 or more mechanics served the booking; the single-mechanic frame (seed TS-260910-0091) hides the section."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "OGpqd",
          "name": "Note · Submit",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 260,
          "content": "Submitting: CTA shows the spinner + \"Mengirim ulasan\", form stays. Success: the same screen swaps to the read-only ReviewRecap + snackbar \"Ulasan terkirim. Terima kasih!\" + CTA \"Kembali ke detail booking\" → S20 (shows \"Lihat ulasan\"). Failure: FormErrorBanner + retry (annotation). Comment counter uses tabular figures."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "GCgEK",
          "name": "Note · Tablet-Landscape",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 240,
          "content": "Form 560 left, live ReviewRecap preview 400 right: empty placeholder → filling (updates as the user rates and types) → final recap after submit. The form column scrolls above the CTA when text scale grows; the CTA stays reachable (pinned at the column foot)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "z8xrMR",
          "name": "Note · Entry",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Reached only from S20 \"Beri ulasan\" once the invoice is paid; system back returns to S20. Keyboard-open frame: comment field focused, bar stays above the keyboard."
        }
      ]
    },
