          "name": "S20 Note · Tablet layout",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 333,
          "content": "Tab-P: back-only app bar (no rail), content centered at max 720. Tab-L: overview left (header + fleet progress, 592) / unit list + actions right (616); the two columns scroll independently. Disabled-action reasons and the Selesai gate are unchanged from the phone frames."
