    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "r8NMpp",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 27569,
      "name": "Handoff Notes / S06 Notifikasi",
      "width": 560,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "uz5mW",
          "name": "Note · Read state",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 230,
          "content": "Unread = accent dot + semibold title + hidden Semantics label \"Belum dibaca\" (never color alone). Tap marks the item read, then navigates. \"Tandai semua dibaca\" sits in the first group's header row (disabled at 0 unread); the S05 bell badge drops live. Semantics per tile: \"Belum dibaca. PCX 160 sedang diperiksa. Status. 10.26\"."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "TRemi",
          "name": "Note · Destinations",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 210,
          "content": "Unit status → S21 of that unit (-C, -B, -A). Booking confirmation and check-in → S20. Invoice ready → S23 (finished booking goes to the invoice, not S24). Promo → S10 with the voucher carried (HEMAT25 / DISKON10; S17 is reachable only from S16). Reminder → S10 with the motor preselected (Supra X 125)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "DmpnR",
          "name": "Note · Layout",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 210,
          "content": "Pushed page from the S05 bell: back arrow, no NavBar / NavRail at any size. Groups: Hari ini / Minggu ini (last 7 days) / Lebih lama, rows on a card with 1 dp dividers. Tablet: list max-width 720, centered. Title and body wrap with no line clamp (nothing is truncated, the row grows; checked at text x1.3); the whole tile is the tap target (min 72 dp)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "XEORV",
          "name": "Note · States",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 210,
          "content": "Empty: EmptyState Notifikasi. Loading: skeleton rows, static shimmer (reduce-motion: none). All read: dots gone, action disabled. New status changes arrive while the app is open: the list prepends, the bell badge and S05 update. Notifikasi switch off (S25): no new items, no badge; old ones stay readable."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "y7cHnB",
          "name": "Note · Semantics",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Back = \"Kembali\". Bell on S05 = \"Notifikasi, 2 belum dibaca\". New items arriving while the list is open are announced through a polite live region (\"Notifikasi baru\"). Keyboard / switch access: every tile shows the 2 dp focus ring (see the focus specimens on the component sheet)."
        }
      ]
    },
