          "content": "Step 18 lane — Default light + dark. Menu left, Pratinjau tema right."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "oGP82",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 73146,
      "name": "Handoff Notes / S25 Profil",
      "width": 560,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "SZFoc",
          "name": "Note · Tema",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Tema = segmented control Sistem / Terang / Gelap (radio-group Semantics, selected = accent fill + semibold + icon, never color alone). Applies live and persists; Sistem follows the OS and is the default. Tab-L right panel \"Pratinjau tema\" is a mini app forced to the chosen theme."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "hVTAG",
          "name": "Note · Notifikasi",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "One master switch (48 dp target, whole row toggles; Semantics \"Notifikasi, aktif\"). Off = no new in-app notifications and no bell badge; existing items stay readable in S06. No off-state frame."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "B8GKNI",
          "name": "Note · Navigasi",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Mode Demo row (tag \"Demo\") pushes S26 with no NavBar. Tentang aplikasi = bottom sheet on phone, centered modal 560 on tablet (no links). Keluar = neutral confirm \"Keluar dari akun?\": session cleared only → S03, garage / bookings / drafts stay on the device."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "Fgjpx",
          "name": "Note · Layout",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "AppShell (Profil tab): Compact NavBar, Medium rail, Large extended rail. Phone 1-col; Tab-P menu column max 560 centered; Tab-L menu 480 left + preview right. 150 ms segment change feedback (reduce-motion: none). Text x1.3 frame checks the segmented labels and the two-line subtitles."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "pnM2a",
          "name": "Note · Semantics",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Back = \"Kembali\"; sheet / modal close = \"Tutup\". Tema = radio group \"Tema\" with Sistem / Terang / Gelap. Notifikasi = \"Notifikasi, aktif\". Rows and segments show the 2 dp focus ring for keyboard / switch access. \"Keluar dari akun?\": focus starts on \"Batal\", Escape cancels."
        }
      ]
    },
