    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "NbLBw",
      "x": 2800,
      "y": 75274,
      "name": "Handoff Notes / S26 Mode Demo",
      "width": 560,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "VFT6j",
          "name": "Note · Kecepatan",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Kecepatan otomatis = segmented Mati / 15 dtk / 5 dtk (default 15 dtk, PRD 05 TrackingSimulator interval). Mati = manual stepping only. The choice persists and applies to running simulations at once (radio-group Semantics)."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "reagK",
          "name": "Note · Status",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Majukan = one stage forward (Terjadwal → Check-in → Diperiksa → Dikerjakan → QC → Selesai), Reset = back to Terjadwal, per unit; \"Majukan semua\" / \"Reset semua\" act on all units. Majukan is disabled at Selesai. Same TrackingSimulator as the S21 DemoModeShortcut; each change pushes an S06 notification and updates S05 / S20 / S21 live. Tab-L: the selected row drives the preview timeline."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "dPN1B",
          "name": "Note · Galat",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "One-shot: switch on → armed banner \"Aksi berikutnya akan gagal\"; the next mock write (confirm booking, Tandai lunas, save motor) returns Result.error, the switch returns to Off, and that screen shows its error UI + \"Coba lagi\". Indicator on S26 only."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "hJMCz",
          "name": "Note · Data & layout",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Danger dialog \"Reset semua data?\" restores the PRD 05 seed (garage, bookings, draft, notification read-state, invoices, reviews); session, theme, demo settings stay. Snackbar \"Data demo dikembalikan\", then Home. Pushed page from S25, no NavBar / NavRail. Every panel carries the MODE DEMO label on an inset surface. At text x1.3 the booking-level buttons wrap to a column."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "h61ba",
          "name": "Note · Semantics",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "Buttons repeat per unit, so each carries the unit in its Semantics label: \"Majukan Unit -A, Vario 125\", \"Reset Unit -A, Vario 125\"; batch buttons = \"Majukan semua unit\" / \"Reset semua unit\". Kecepatan otomatis = radio group. Armed banner, auto-disarm and the reset result use a polite live region (\"Galat simulasi aktif\", \"Galat simulasi selesai\", \"Data demo dikembalikan\")."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "ZKVyd",
          "name": "Note Motion",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 219,
          "content": "MOTION — Majukan advances the StatusTimeline with the S21 reveal (300 ms staggered); the armed-error banner, the speed control and the panel selection change in 150 ms ease-out. Under MediaQuery.disableAnimations every change is instant and each state keeps its text label (speed value, armed banner, Selesai)."
        }
      ]
    },
